 "description": "StartBankingApplication opens a business account application for a company.  A company may have only one undecided application at a time; starting a second is refused rather than splitting the answers across two records. The path says where the answers will come from \u2014 WARM_FORMATION when the company was formed with Lovie and most of the form can be carried over, COLD_MANUAL when the applicant types them in.",
